# Prompt/plan telemetry. ledger.ledger_path() (backend/ledger.py:54-58) resolves
# PROMPT_LEDGER_PATH, then /gcs, then config.ROOT -- and config.ROOT is this
# directory. Deployed, the real ledger lives on the GCS mount and is unaffected
# by this line; locally and under pytest it lands here. Only
# tests/test_ledger_failures.py redirects the env var, so every other test that
# reaches record_plan_outcome() appends to the repo root instead: 1029 rows, all
# stamped with pytest tmp-project names, were sitting here and were swept into a
# commit by a `git add -A`. Test debris must not be committable.
prompt_ledger.jsonl
